      "UsesAmmoSameLocationOnly"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Armored Infantry",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Trinity is really three different battle armors, all initially constructed by the Capellan Confederation and therefore sharing the same base chassis. The Ying Long (\"Shadow Dragon\") uses the mimetic armor first created by Word of Blake for their Purifier, though how they acquired the technology is unknown. The Asterion and Theseus are functionally identical, but have different aesthetics.",
